OL,3,GNEWSACats found living under hospital  
OL,4,Agenerator rescued                      
OL,6,FA family of stray cats found living    
OL,7,Funderneath a hospital generator have   
OL,8,Fbeen rescued after being nurtured by   
OL,9,Fstaff.                                 
OL,11,FThe two adults and two kittens were    
OL,12,Fdiscovered at Bradford Royal Infirmary 
OL,13,Fwhen the mother gave birth beneath the 
OL,14,Ffenced-off power unit outside the      
OL,15,Fmaternity block.                       
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
