OL,3,GNEWSACats found living under hospital  
OL,4,Agenerator rescued                      
OL,6,FInitially unable to reach them, staff  
OL,7,Ftook turns to keep an eye on the       
OL,8,Fanimals for three weeks before, with   
OL,9,Fthe help of Allerton Cat Rescue, the   
OL,10,Ffather and two kittens were caught and 
OL,11,Ftaken into care. Efforts to catch and  
OL,12,Fhouse the mother are ongoing.          
OL,14,FMelissa Barker, a senior sister in the 
OL,15,Fneonatal unit, was one of the nurses   
OL,16,Finvolved and said the rescue had united
OL,17,Fstaff in a "shared mission".           
